Error [jet.ValueThrownAway]: The result of `answer` is thrown away
  --> tests/ui/marker_local_shadows_prelude_hook.jet:13:5
    |
 13 |     answer()
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: `answer` is pure (it has no effects and changes nothing through `&`), so this line does nothing
 Fix: Use the result, bind it with `result: answer`, or write `.drop("reason")` if dropping it is intended
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0433
